# ==============================================================
# 🚀 CAMPUSIFY ADMIN API - GOD MODE TESTING SUITE
# ==============================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@deviceId = postman-master-device-007
@adminToken = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1Ni... (Paste your token here after admin login)

### -----------------------------------------------------------
### 📊 1. ANALYTICS & DASHBOARD
### -----------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/dashboard-stats
x-device-id: {{deviceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### -----------------------------------------------------------
### 🛡️ 2. SECURITY & ANTI-PIRACY (GOD MODE)
### -----------------------------------------------------------

# 👉 A. UNLOCK DEVICE (Clear device cache for student)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/security/unlock-device
Content-Type: application/json
x-device-id: {{deviceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{ "email": "student@gmail.com" }

###

# 👉 B. BAN/UNBAN USER (Permanent Ban -> leave banDays empty)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/security/toggle-ban
Content-Type: application/json
x-device-id: {{deviceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{ 
    "email": "hacker@gmail.com", 
    "banDays": 7,  
    "reason": "Used Screen Recorder during video playback" 
}

###

# 👉 C. CHECK SUSPICIOUS LOGS
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/security/suspicious-logs
x-device-id: {{deviceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

# 👉 D. REVEAL PASSWORD (Decrypt GCM Secret Key)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/security/reveal-password
Content-Type: application/json
x-device-id: {{deviceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{ "email": "student@gmail.com" }

### -----------------------------------------------------------
### 💰 3. MANUAL OPERATIONS & ACCESS
### -----------------------------------------------------------

# 👉 A. GRANT OR REVOKE ACCESS MANUALLY
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/manual-access
Content-Type: application/json
x-device-id: {{deviceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
    "email": "student@gmail.com",
    "semesterId": "6a43db325f8bc9f5233bedfd",
    "action": "grant" 
}

###

# 👉 B. REORDER COURSE SEQUENCE
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/subject/reorder
Content-Type: application/json
x-device-id: {{deviceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
    "orderedIds": [
        "6a43db325f8bc9f5233b0001",
        "6a43db325f8bc9f5233b0002",
        "6a43db325f8bc9f5233b0003"
    ]
}

### -----------------------------------------------------------
### 🚀 4. CURRICULUM SETUP (Basic CRUD)
### -----------------------------------------------------------

# 👉 A. CREATE BRANCH
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/branch
Content-Type: application/json
x-device-id: {{deviceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
    "name": "Civil Engineering",
    "shortName": "CE",
    "description": "Core mechanics & Design",
    "isActive": true
}

###

# 👉 B. TOGGLE SEMESTER PUBLISH (Hide/Show)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/semester/6a43db325f8bc9f5233bedfd/toggle-publish
x-device-id: {{deviceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}